<title>SWITZERLAND: Winterthur posts 6-mo profit for 1st time.</title>
<headline>Winterthur posts 6-mo profit for 1st time.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>				   (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     248.4	     vs n/a</p>
<p> Gross premiums		 14,295.8	  vs 12,172.0</p>
<p> Net investment income	2,778.6	   vs n/a</p>
<p> Investments		    78,262.3	  vs 67,317.8</p>
<p> Insurance reserves	   72,152.3	  vs 67,535.4</p>
<p> Shareholder equity	   4,421.5	   vs 4,030.7</p>
<p>Note - Full name Winterthur Insurance Co. Insurance reserve and shareholder equity figures for prior period are end-1995 data.  </p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		 519.2	     vs n/a</p>
<p> Taxes			    196.9	     vs n/a</p>
<p> Minority interests	   53.4		vs n/a</p>
<p>Results for non-life business:</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		 400.6	     vs n/a</p>
<p> Gross premiums		 8,399.8	   vs 6,886.8</p>
<p> Underwriting results	 395.6 (loss)    vs n/a</p>
<p> Net investment income	837.5	     vs n/a</p>
<p>Results for life business:</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		 118.6	     vs n/a</p>
<p> Gross premiums		 5,896.0	   vs 5,285.2</p>
<p> Net investment income	1,941.1	   vs n/a</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
